    {
      "id": "e547f6aa-8764-486f-9f1d-c0ef0c52c029",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        7744,
        2800
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "##Smart Receipt & Expense Tracker — Telegram + Gemini + Drive + Sheets\n### How it works\n\n1. Receives and normalizes incoming Telegram messages to determine the user's intent.\n2. Routes messages to either generate monthly summaries or process uploaded receipt images.\n3. Uses an AI Vision model (Gemini) to extract structured expense details from receipt images.\n4. Checks for duplicate submissions, verifies expenses that require review, and archives copies to Google Drive.\n5. Appends verified expense records to Google Sheets and notifies the user with confirmation summaries.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- - [ ] Configure your Telegram Bot API credentials in the Telegram trigger and message nodes.\n- [ ] Connect your Google account for Google Sheets and Google Drive nodes.\n- [ ] Set up a Google Gemini API credential for the AI Vision receipt extraction chain.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust Google Sheets document IDs, range names, and Google Drive folder paths to match your personal file structure."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
